{"id":"75899757335831ab","group":"58","path":"58/batch08/58-df-measurable-set.md","title":"Measurable Set","display":"df-measurable-set — Measurable Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-measurable-set","aliases":["58-df-measurable-set","Measurable Set"],"display":"df-measurable-set — Measurable Set","depends_on":["[[../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-measurable-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-measurable-set</span><span>Measurable Set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-measurable-set — Measurable Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a740bdad87b97ac6\" href=\"?note=a740bdad87b97ac6\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md\">../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SigmaAlgebra}\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{SigmaAlgebra}\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (sigma-algebra predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a740bdad87b97ac6\" href=\"?note=a740bdad87b97ac6\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md\">../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq X\">\\(A\\subseteq X\\)</span> (set parameter)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MeasurableSet}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{MeasurableSet}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (measurable-set predicate defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\mathcal F,A\\in V\">\\(X,\\mathcal F,A\\in V\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}measurable\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{MeasurableSet}_S(A,X,\\mathcal F) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal F,X)\\land A\\in\\mathcal F\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}measurable\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{MeasurableSet}_S(A,X,\\mathcal F) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal F,X)\\land A\\in\\mathcal F\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Measurable set: member of the sigma-algebra</li>\n<li>Lebesgue: completion of Borel if <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu\">\\(\\mu\\)</span> is Radon</li>\n<li>Carathéodory: defines measure by outer measure restriction</li>\n<li>Null set: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu(A) = 0\">\\(\\mu(A) = 0\\)</span>, negligible sets</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Rudin, Real and Complex Analysis</li>\n<li>Folland, Real Analysis</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md","status":"resolved","id":"a740bdad87b97ac6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md","status":"resolved","id":"a740bdad87b97ac6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{SigmaAlgebra}\\subseteq V^2$ (sigma-algebra predicate, see [[../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{SigmaAlgebra}\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MeasurableSet}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"X,\\mathcal F,A\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}measurable\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{MeasurableSet}_S(A,X,\\mathcal F) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal F,X)\\land A\\in\\mathcal F","display":true},{"tex":"\\mu","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu(A) = 0","display":false}],"bytes":1030,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-832","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-measurable-set.md|58-df-measurable-set]]（batch08）"}],"outgoing":["a740bdad87b97ac6"]}